            "description": "Actualización parcial.\n\n**Body (todos opcionales):** `site_id`, `start_date`, `end_date`, `type`, `reference_id`.\n\n`type` solo acepta: `maintenance`, `manual_block`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete block",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/blocks/{{block_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "blocks", "{{block_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Eliminación lógica (soft delete). **Respuesta:** `204 No Content`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "CRUD `/v1/blocks`"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reservations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create reservation",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const body = json.data !== undefined ? json.data : json;",
                  "  if (body && body.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('reservation_id', String(body.id));",
                  "    pm.environment.set('reservation_id', String(body.id));",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"site_id\": {{site_id}},\n  \"source\": \"internal\",\n  \"user_id\": {{user_id}},\n  \"checkin\": \"2026-05-21\",\n  \"checkout\": \"2026-05-25\",\n  \"guests\": 2,\n  \"pets\": 0,\n  \"subtotal\": 500,\n  \"commission\": 50\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/reservations",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "reservations"]
            },
            "description": "Crea una reserva en estado `pending`.\n\n**Prerrequisitos:**\n1. Disponibilidad creada para el `site_id` con `is_available: true` en la fecha de `checkin`.\n2. El sitio debe existir en MySQL (`sites`).\n\n**Body requerido:**\n| Campo | Tipo | Notas |\n|-------|------|-------|\n| `site_id` | int | ID del sitio |\n| `source` | string | `internal`, `airbnb`, `booking`, `vrbo` |\n| `user_id` | int | ID de usuario |\n| `checkin` | string | `YYYY-MM-DD` — debe coincidir con un registro de availability disponible |\n| `checkout` | string | `YYYY-MM-DD` |\n| `guests` | int | |\n| `pets` | int | |\n| `subtotal` | number | |\n| `commission` | number | |\n\nAl crear, marca la availability del checkin como no disponible."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm reservation",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/reservations/{{reservation_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "reservations", "{{reservation_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Confirma una reserva (`status` → `confirmed`).\n\n**Path:** `id` — entero (usa `{{reservation_id}}`).\n\nSin body."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel reservation",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/reservations/{{reservation_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "reservations", "{{reservation_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Cancela una reserva (`status` → `cancelled`).\n\n**Path:** `id` — entero (usa `{{reservation_id}}`).\n\nSin body."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Reservas `/v1/reservations` — crear, confirmar y cancelar."
    }
